{
  "id": "LUK.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 7",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 50,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpījiwa kwa ntūmami wa nshilikale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala kūbasomboolela pyī ī mihayo yakwe, wingīla mu nzengo gwa Kapelanaumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīmo ntaale nebe wa bashilikale igana, walī na nsese wakwe antogilwe jigi; alīyo ū nsese ng'wenūyo walī nsaatu hihī na kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū ntaale wa bashilikale igana ng'wenūyo aho wajiigwa ī mhola ja ng'wa Yesu, ūtūma banamhala ba Bayudaya bampeeleele, bakang'wikūmbīlīje ize ampīje ū nsese okwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashika a halī Yesu būng'wikūmbīlīja balīhaya gīkī, “Ū munhū ng'wenūyo īkūbeelela ūng'wītīle ū mhayo gwenūyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno alītogilwe no ī lihanga lise; nīyo watūzengela n'isinagogi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū Yesu ūgumha ajile nabo, alīyo aho wegeela kūshika a ha kaya, ū ntaale wa bashilikale igana ng'wenūyo ūtūma banwani biye kūja kūng'wīla ū Yesu gīkī, “Seeba ūtī na nguno ya kwikoya; ū nene natigeleelilwe ū bebe ūshike ha ng'wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene naalī nabona gīkī ū nene ng'wenekīlī natigeleelilwe nūūlū ū kwiza ū kūlī bebe; ū bebe ng'wene hayaga mhayo dūhū akūpīla ū nsese wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nane nalī munhū ūyo atūūlilwe ha sīlīlī ya būsugi; nalī na bashilikale a ha sīlīlī yane. Nadūgije kūng'wīla ūyū gīkī, ‘Jaga;’ ng'hana akūja. Nūūlū ūngī gīkī, ‘Nzūgū;’ ng'hana akwiza. Nūūlū nsese wane nashikile kūng'wīla, ‘ītaga gīkī,’ na ng'hana akwīta!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho wigwa gīko akankumya ū munhū ng'wenūyo, ūlīgalūkīla ī libita lya banhū īlo lyanondeelaga; ūbawīla gīkī, “Nalīmuwīla nataalī kūbona na hado yaya kūzunya kwa mbika īyī hose hose ū mu Isiraeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashoka ī kaya abo baalī batūng'wa būsanga ū nsese opīlaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūjūūchiwa ng'witūnja wa nchīlwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ntondo yaho, ū Yesu ūja nabo a bahemba bakwe, hamò n'ibita itaale, būūkashika kū nzengo gūmò gwitanagwa Naini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohayegeela a ha mita ūmanhya na banhū balīfuma ū mu nzengo, babūūkije mimba. Walī wazumalīka ndinha nebe, ng'witūnja myalwa ūmò wike wa nkīma ūyo walī wamala kūchīlwa ngoshi; n'ibita itaale kūfuma ū mu nzengo lyalī hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba aho wamona ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūnsaatwa; ūng'wīla, “Ūtalīlage!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wegeela wīkuumya ī macheela, bīmīīla abo baalī bībūūkije; nang'hwe ūhaya gīkī, “Nsūmba nalīkūwīla būūkaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo walī achile ūgūngūmūka wigasha, wandya na kūyomba; hūna ū Yesu ūng'winha kūlī nina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a bose bogoha no, būyūnkumīlīja Mulungu dūhū balīhaya, “Ng'hangi ntaale watwilongelile.” Na gīkī, “Ū Mulungu wabagenihile a banhū bakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūkumo lokwe lūsambaala pye a hose ū mu sī ya Būyudaya, nū mu sī ījo jibīmbīkanilwe nayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibūjo lya ng'wa Yohana kūlī Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba bakwe ū Yohana būng'wīla pyī ī yose yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbitana babīlī ba bahemba bakwe, ūbatūma kūja ū kūlī Seeba bakamūje gīkī, “Ū bebe hū ūlī ng'wene ūyo izile, nūūlū hamo tūnindīīle ūngī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba aho bashika ū kūlī Seeba būhaya, “Ū Yohana Matīīja watūtūmaga twize tūkūbūje gīkī, ‘Ū bebe, hū ūlī ng'wene ūyo izile, nūūlū hamo tūnindīīle ūngī?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo ū Yesu wapījaga banhū bingī kūfuma mu būsaatu na būlemehazu; bangī wabīngījaga masamva, na babboku bingī wabinhaga kūbona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbashokeja ūbawīla, “Jagi mukang'wīle ū Yohana īyo mulīyigwa na kwībona: A babboku balībona, na a balema balīshimīza, a ba mbiji bakwelaga, a bagulu bakwigwaga; pye na a bafu balījūūka, na a bahabī balīlomeelwa Ng'hūlū Jawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo alī na lubango būlī ng'wene ūyo atī na kwipama kūlwa nguno yane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bīnga abo baalī batūng'wa na Yohana, ū Yesu wandya kūbawīla a banhū mihayo ya ng'wa Yohana. Ūhaya gīkī, “Aho ng'wajaga kū matogolo, ng'wajaga kūjūlola kī? Kadete kakūyengejiagwa nyaga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'walī mutogilwe kūbona kī? Hamo munhū nkondooku azwalīlile nyasabi? Managi gīkī abo bakazwalaga myenda ya nyasabi na kūyegela būpanga bo mīlī, balī mu kaya ja batemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Numho lūūlū ng'wajaga kūlola kī? Hamo ng'hangi? Alichene, nīyo nalīmuwīla alī ntaale kūtinda ng'hangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūyū hū ng'wene ūyo gwandīkilwe kūlwakwe gīkī, ‘Managa gīkī nalīntūma ntūmījiwa wane kū būtongi wako, akūtonga kūkūbeeja beegeja nzīla.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla gīkī ū mu bose abo babyalilwe na bakīma, atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo alī ntaale kūntinda Yohana. Alīyo ūyo alī ndo wa bado ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu ankīlile ū wei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū abo bandegelekaga, hamò na a batobisha ba goodi bakazunya gīkī ū Mulungu ntūngīlīja; nguno baalī babatīījiwa mu būbatīīja bo ng'wa Yohana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a Bafalisayo na a balangi ba shilagīlo, bakabūlema ū būhūgūji bo ng'wa Mulungu ū kūbo, īkī baalī batabatīījiwe nū Yohana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hīmba nabikolanīje na kī a banhū ba shibyalīlwe īshi? Nabalenganīje na kī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batikīlile na baana bigashaga ng'wigūlilū bakwihamukīlaga na bichabo; bakūhayaga gīkī, ‘A bing'we, ni ginehe twalūmufuulīlaga mbiilūlū alīyo ning'we ū kūbina yaya; hama hangī aho twandya kūlīla ng'hūngū nahene mutapīnīhalile!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Yohana Matīīja akiza atūlyaga shilīwa nūūlū kūng'wa mvinya yaya; muyūhaya, ‘Alī n'isamva!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ng'wana wa Munhū aho wiza akūlyaga na kūng'wa hangī, nahene ng'wandije kūhaya gīkī, ‘Nolagi ū munhū ūyū; naku na neevi, nīyo anwanile na batobisha ba goodi, būyaga na banhū ba shibi!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a baana bago a masala, a bose bagisaabile gīkī galī būtūngīlīja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlekejiwa kwa nkīma wa shibi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūmò wa Bafalisayo ūng'wegeleja ū Yesu ha ng'wakwe, gīkī ize kūlya shilīwa hamò nang'hwe; ng'hana wingīla ū mu numba ya Mfalisayo ng'wenūyo, wigasha kūlya ī shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu nzengo gwenūyo walīmo nkīma wa shibi; aho wadeeba gīkī ū Yesu walī wigasha ū mu ng'wa Mfalisayo ng'wenūyo, wiza na jūbba ya alabasta yokalile maguta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohayūshika wīmīīla ha numa ya ng'wa Yesu, hihī na mhambala jakwe, kūnū akūlīlaga. Ūjilobya shisoji ī mhambala ja ng'wa Yesu, hūna wandya kūjipyagūla na nzwīlī jakwe; wanoga ūyūjibbipa, hama ūjibila maguta ayo walī nago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mfalisayo ūyo walī wang'wegeleja aho wabona gīko, wandya kwiwīla ū mung'holò yakwe gīkī, “Ū munhū ng'wenūyū ūlū ni ng'hangi, ni wandeebaga ū nkīma ūyo alikala ūnkuumya kuumya ng'wenūyū, pyī nī nhūngwa jakwe; nguno wabūbi no!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūnshokeja ūng'wīla gīkī, “Simoni nalī na mhayo gwa kūkūwīla.” Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Yombaga Nangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūhaya, “Baalīho banhū babīlī, baalī na būgasa na munhū nebe. Ūmò būgasa bo denali magana atanò, ūngī denali makūmi atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bose bakagayiwa ī sha kūnshokeja ū ng'wenekīlī sabo, wanoga nose ūbalekeja pyī būbīlī wabo. Ū mu būbīlī wabo gīko, alī kinehe ūyo akūbiza na būyegi kūtinda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Simoni ūshosha ūhaya, “Naliganika ūyo akalekejiwa būgasa būtaale.” Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūshosha ūng'wīla, “Watūngīlīja ū mu kalamulīle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūngalūkīla ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, ūng'wīla ū Simoni gīkī, “Ūlīmona ū mayū ng'wenūyū? Aho nalingīla ū mu ng'wako, ū bebe ūtaninhile nūūlū minzī ga kooja mhambala jane, alīyo ū ng'wene wajilobya ī mhambala jane na shisoji shakwe, hama ūjipyagūla na nzwīlī jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ū bebe ūtagemile kūnibbipa nūūlū hado. Alīyo ū ng'wene, kūfuma haho ningīlīlaga, ataalī ū koya ū kūjibbipa ī mhambala jane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nīyo ū bebe ūtaalī nūūlū kūnibila maguta kū ntwe, alīyo ū ng'wene wajibila maguta ī mhambala jane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nalīkūwīla gīkī, walekejiagwa ī shibi shakwe nūūlū īkī shilī shingī, h'ī nguno yene aloolecha būtogwa būtaale, alīyo ūyo alekejiwe shido, nū būtogwa bokwe būdo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla ū nkīma ng'wenūyo gīkī, “Walekejiagwa ī shibi shako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo baalī bigasha nang'hwe a ha shilīwa bandya kūduguma kūnū baliwīla gīkī, “Ū ng'wenūyū ni nani ī gete wa kūyūlekeja na shibi ū wei?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu ūng'wīla ū nkīma ng'wenūyo gīkī, “Jaga mu mhola, ū kūzunya kwako kwakūpījaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
